Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: crowpil-battery-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms
Recommends: linux-headers
Description: DKMS package for the CrowPi-L battery power_supply module
 Registers a CrowPi-L battery as a Linux power_supply device via I2C.
 Rebuilds automatically whenever a new kernel is installed.

